    "Con tu Orbital conectada, «Ver en la TV» pone en la consola lo que ves aquí, donde ibas, y tu Trakt y las claves de Para ti salen de ella.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your Orbital connected, “Watch on TV” plays what you're watching here on the console, right where you were, and your Trakt and For You keys come from it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
